# Faazio mobile app — ANDROID platform environment (committed).
#
# Loaded by scripts/configure.js when CONFIGURE_PLATFORM=android, or (for a
# platform-agnostic run such as `npm run start` / `ts:check`) alongside .env.ios.
# Process env (CI secrets) always wins over this file.
#
# scripts/configure.js writes these into:
#   - Android: android/app/src/main/res/values/google_maps_api_key.xml (build-time native key)
#   - config.ts: GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_ANDROID (read by the JS map layer)

# Google Maps SDK for Android. Restrict it to the app package (com.faazio.customer /
# com.faazio.deliverypartner / com.faazio.sellerpartner) + the release SHA-1 in Google Cloud.
# Empty => the seller shop-pin map renders blank; everything else still works.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_ANDROID=AIzaSyDrfxMIhLZynmGLCGNSDZa_yeplAc2kx04
